# Report-only SwiftFormat config (Phase 1, Workstream C).
#
# CI runs `swiftformat --lint` in a non-blocking job, so this reports what would
# change without rewriting anything yet. A full auto-format pass is deliberately
# deferred: doing it now would create a huge diff that collides with the planned
# Phase 3 file splits. Run `swiftformat .` to apply once the big refactors land.

--swiftversion 5.0
--exclude build,DerivedData,.build
